1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:16,220
Rathal saw at once that the Unsullied Flame was a gift from the Great Soul.

2
00:00:16,700 --> 00:00:20,660
He resolved to harness its power with technology and created Amaterasu.

3
00:00:22,180 --> 00:00:26,960
By the light of Amaterasu's sacred flame, the people began to rebuild.

4
00:00:26,960 --> 00:00:31,180
With its power, they established a new state in the Far East.

5
00:00:31,180 --> 00:00:36,180
The Far East

6
00:00:36,180 --> 00:00:59,180
Stop it! That might seem worthless to you, but to Vulcan it's a precious memory that he shared with his family!

7
00:00:59,180 --> 00:01:03,180
Please! Just leave him alone!

8
00:01:03,180 --> 00:01:21,980
Heard a commotion over the wire I planted on Iris, so I thought I'd come by.

9
00:01:21,980 --> 00:01:27,980
Howie!

10
00:01:27,980 --> 00:01:30,980
Thanks a bunch, now get me out of this thing!

11
00:01:30,980 --> 00:01:32,980
I was planning to relax a moment.

12
00:01:32,980 --> 00:01:35,980
I can't! Everyone at the workshop is in danger right now!

13
00:01:35,980 --> 00:01:39,980
Though I could always just take you home as you are.

14
00:01:39,980 --> 00:01:52,980
I regret my choice already.

15
00:01:55,980 --> 00:01:56,980
Another one?

16
00:01:57,980 --> 00:01:58,980
Arthur! What's happening?

17
00:01:58,980 --> 00:02:01,980
Giovanni's in the workshop! Go take him out!

18
00:02:01,980 --> 00:02:02,980
Go take him out!

19
00:02:02,980 --> 00:02:29,980
I should have guessed. You would hide it in some piece of junk. With this secured, all that's left is to dispose of you.

20
00:02:29,980 --> 00:02:44,980
That's why I'm called Smash the Doctor's creepy-nosent man! Get away from my company's new engineer!

21
00:02:44,980 --> 00:02:48,060
Here's the special

22
00:02:49,980 --> 00:02:50,000
Okay, hit here.

23
00:02:53,980 --> 00:02:54,980
Please.

24
00:02:54,980 --> 00:03:13,860
Take what you got and leave now

25
00:03:13,860 --> 00:03:15,840
You're wearing out your welcome

26
00:03:15,840 --> 00:03:19,460
No one here wants to see you here, yeah

27
00:03:19,460 --> 00:03:21,860
Think that you won from day one

28
00:03:21,860 --> 00:03:23,820
Once the devil will come

29
00:03:23,820 --> 00:03:27,540
You know just why he wants you, don't you?

30
00:03:27,740 --> 00:03:29,500
Your crooked desire

31
00:03:29,500 --> 00:03:31,600
It doesn't feel so right

32
00:03:31,600 --> 00:03:33,580
Misguided, defighted

33
00:03:33,580 --> 00:03:35,320
It's a part of the reason

34
00:03:35,320 --> 00:03:37,380
You're starting a fire

35
00:03:37,380 --> 00:03:39,760
You're gonna watch it burn

36
00:03:39,760 --> 00:03:42,700
Try to save yourself like you always do

37
00:03:42,700 --> 00:03:45,580
Every bridge we build

38
00:03:45,580 --> 00:03:48,560
You think it's just a burning death

39
00:03:48,560 --> 00:03:50,940
Just burn it down

40
00:03:50,940 --> 00:03:53,860
When everything is gone

41
00:03:53,860 --> 00:03:56,620
You'll wish you only hurt us out

42
00:03:56,620 --> 00:03:58,400
Hurt us out

43
00:03:58,400 --> 00:03:59,200
Screaming

44
00:03:59,200 --> 00:04:02,120
Meiji

45
00:04:03,120 --> 00:04:06,080
Meiji

46
00:04:07,040 --> 00:04:10,080
Meiji

47
00:04:11,040 --> 00:04:14,000
Meiji

48
00:04:14,000 --> 00:04:21,320
Shinra, you're here

49
00:04:21,320 --> 00:04:21,460
Shinra, you're here

50
00:04:21,460 --> 00:04:27,380
You're with them?

51
00:04:27,380 --> 00:04:28,520
But why?

52
00:04:30,680 --> 00:04:32,020
You okay, Vulcan?

53
00:04:32,400 --> 00:04:33,240
Can you move?

54
00:04:33,800 --> 00:04:35,300
Feel like I'm gonna need a minute

55
00:04:35,300 --> 00:04:37,580
Took a beating and a blast to the chest

56
00:04:37,580 --> 00:04:42,380
Shinra Kusakabe

57
00:04:42,380 --> 00:04:45,200
Shinra, how'd you escape your restraints?

58
00:04:46,260 --> 00:04:47,340
No matter

59
00:04:47,340 --> 00:04:51,640
I can capture you again once I've dealt with these pests

60
00:04:51,640 --> 00:04:54,760
Thought you guys weren't supposed to let anyone in there

61
00:04:54,760 --> 00:05:00,740
Damn it, so annoying

62
00:05:00,740 --> 00:05:02,760
My shimmers?

63
00:05:03,100 --> 00:05:04,100
I'm sure they are

64
00:05:04,100 --> 00:05:05,620
Since unlike your comrade

65
00:05:05,620 --> 00:05:08,800
You compulsively parry every attack that's thrown at you

66
00:05:08,800 --> 00:05:11,440
You've fallen for my every fate

67
00:05:11,440 --> 00:05:16,860
Warm air becomes light and rises

68
00:05:16,860 --> 00:05:18,840
Whilst cold air does the opposite

69
00:05:18,840 --> 00:05:23,100
You make your illusions by manipulating differences in air density

70
00:05:23,100 --> 00:05:27,440
So if I supply enough heat to make those minute differences irrelevant

71
00:05:27,440 --> 00:05:29,500
Your shimmers fade away

72
00:05:29,500 --> 00:05:31,460
You have no chance

73
00:05:31,460 --> 00:05:33,720
Now, let's end this

74
00:05:33,720 --> 00:05:37,740
Take it easy, I'm on your side

75
00:05:37,740 --> 00:05:40,180
All gravel's the same to me

76
00:05:40,180 --> 00:05:43,320
Except for Shinra

77
00:05:43,320 --> 00:05:47,600
Rise, fishing fire

78
00:05:47,600 --> 00:05:50,600
Wrap him up and hold him in place

79
00:05:50,600 --> 00:05:52,920
What is this?

80
00:05:53,100 --> 00:05:56,420
My flames are magnetically charged

81
00:05:56,420 --> 00:05:59,920
They sense the magnetic fields around living things

82
00:05:59,920 --> 00:06:01,220
And latch onto them

83
00:06:01,220 --> 00:06:10,060
They caught him

84
00:06:10,060 --> 00:06:15,560
Sister, hit the buttons on that wall

85
00:06:15,560 --> 00:06:25,380
You're doing great, sister

86
00:06:25,380 --> 00:06:26,800
Just keep it up, okay?

87
00:06:26,800 --> 00:06:27,840
Latam

88
00:06:27,840 --> 00:06:29,880
Latam

89
00:06:29,880 --> 00:06:31,880
Latam

90
00:06:31,880 --> 00:06:33,380
Latam

91
00:06:33,380 --> 00:06:34,500
Latam

92
00:06:34,500 --> 00:06:37,060
Everything you've created is pointless

93
00:06:37,060 --> 00:06:41,880
Latam, Latam, Latam, Latam, Latam, Latam, Latam

94
00:06:41,880 --> 00:06:43,700
Latam

95
00:06:43,700 --> 00:06:46,200
If this keeps up, I'll pass out

96
00:06:46,200 --> 00:06:51,200
I think I'll melt this gravel into asphalt

97
00:06:51,200 --> 00:07:04,360
Wait a sec

98
00:07:04,360 --> 00:07:04,380
Wait a sec

99
00:07:04,380 --> 00:07:06,660
Was the sister at it again?

100
00:07:06,660 --> 00:07:21,440
Those machines may be tiny

101
00:07:21,440 --> 00:07:23,740
But each has its own magnetic field

102
00:07:23,740 --> 00:07:25,860
I figured if we release enough of them

103
00:07:25,860 --> 00:07:27,780
We could disrupt the magnetic homing system

104
00:07:27,780 --> 00:07:29,420
Your flames use to target humans

105
00:07:29,420 --> 00:07:31,400
And it looks like I was right

106
00:07:31,400 --> 00:07:44,280
He has the edge in close quarters

107
00:07:44,280 --> 00:07:47,220
I can't maneuver as well in all this gear

108
00:07:47,220 --> 00:07:49,680
Your report led me to believe

109
00:07:49,680 --> 00:07:52,040
That the enemy had been subdued here

110
00:07:52,040 --> 00:07:55,840
Again?

111
00:08:05,640 --> 00:08:06,520
Tell me

112
00:08:06,520 --> 00:08:09,000
Are you the person I just linked with?

113
00:08:09,000 --> 00:08:35,800
That's gotta be you, right?

114
00:08:36,080 --> 00:08:36,720
Your show

115
00:08:36,720 --> 00:08:38,000
Hey, listen

116
00:08:38,000 --> 00:08:39,860
I think that we might be brothers

117
00:08:39,860 --> 00:08:41,040
To be honest

118
00:08:41,040 --> 00:08:42,640
I'm pretty sure of it

119
00:08:42,640 --> 00:08:43,720
I'm Shinra

120
00:08:43,720 --> 00:08:44,580
Your big brother

121
00:08:44,580 --> 00:08:46,140
It's so good to see you

122
00:08:46,140 --> 00:08:48,440
It's your belief that we share blood?

123
00:08:51,400 --> 00:08:53,600
Oh, you're crazy adorable, too

124
00:08:53,600 --> 00:08:56,040
I guess good looks must run in the family

125
00:08:56,040 --> 00:08:57,960
You're gonna be a hit at school, bro

126
00:08:57,960 --> 00:08:59,960
You look like a freaking angel

127
00:08:59,960 --> 00:09:06,120
I can finally make good on my promise now, Mom

128
00:09:06,120 --> 00:09:09,040
I'm gonna protect you

129
00:09:09,040 --> 00:09:10,920
No matter what happens next

130
00:09:10,920 --> 00:09:13,340
I'll always be in your corner, Kay

131
00:09:13,340 --> 00:09:19,100
I see now

132
00:09:19,100 --> 00:09:23,560
The evangelist said I'd know him on sight

133
00:09:23,560 --> 00:09:24,920
And so I do

134
00:09:24,920 --> 00:09:26,780
This is my brother

135
00:09:26,780 --> 00:09:28,360
It's true

136
00:09:28,360 --> 00:09:33,360
This feeling is hard to describe

137
00:09:33,360 --> 00:09:37,640
The only word that comes to mind is disgust

138
00:09:37,640 --> 00:09:43,100
When did he...

139
00:09:43,100 --> 00:09:48,360
As a wielder of the Adola Burst

140
00:09:48,360 --> 00:09:50,100
You need to come with us now

141
00:09:50,100 --> 00:09:53,280
Shinra!

142
00:10:01,280 --> 00:10:02,140
Quite impressive

143
00:10:02,140 --> 00:10:03,740
If he actually reacted

144
00:10:03,740 --> 00:10:04,440
Arthur!

145
00:10:13,660 --> 00:10:15,600
How is he able to move like that?

146
00:10:16,460 --> 00:10:18,340
Why can't I see what he's doing?

147
00:10:19,440 --> 00:10:21,260
I don't get it

148
00:10:21,260 --> 00:10:32,480
Bring the one with the Adola Burst back with us

149
00:10:32,480 --> 00:10:34,680
The rest should be disposed of

150
00:10:34,680 --> 00:10:36,020
Yes, sir

151
00:10:36,020 --> 00:10:37,540
Did you find it?

152
00:10:44,540 --> 00:10:47,860
The key to a Matarasu is ours now

153
00:10:47,860 --> 00:10:57,460
Shinra!

154
00:10:57,620 --> 00:10:58,240
Get in!

155
00:11:04,780 --> 00:11:06,340
Still in one piece, I see

156
00:11:06,340 --> 00:11:08,000
When did you get here?

157
00:11:17,860 --> 00:11:23,160
It's okay

158
00:11:23,160 --> 00:11:23,960
Come on!

159
00:11:47,860 --> 00:11:52,620
Whoa there, Skippy

160
00:11:52,620 --> 00:11:54,600
How'd you get there so quick?

161
00:11:55,200 --> 00:11:55,920
Nice try

162
00:11:55,920 --> 00:11:57,920
The wielder of the Adola Burst

163
00:11:57,920 --> 00:11:59,280
Won't escape my grasp

164
00:11:59,280 --> 00:12:01,340
Sorry, Squirt

165
00:12:01,340 --> 00:12:03,940
But I can't let you have him yet

166
00:12:03,940 --> 00:12:15,360
The heroes arrived

167
00:12:15,360 --> 00:12:17,020
Listen!

168
00:12:17,480 --> 00:12:18,740
I'll come back for you, Sho

169
00:12:18,740 --> 00:12:19,600
I promise!

170
00:12:21,880 --> 00:12:23,780
So you're the man known as Joker

171
00:12:23,780 --> 00:12:24,920
Yeah

172
00:12:24,920 --> 00:12:27,960
Seems my reputation precedes me

173
00:12:27,960 --> 00:12:40,240
That's enough to make even me nervous

174
00:12:40,240 --> 00:12:42,780
Stop interfering in our affairs

175
00:12:42,780 --> 00:12:45,460
I don't intend to let you

176
00:12:45,460 --> 00:12:46,520
Or the Fire Force

177
00:12:46,520 --> 00:12:48,420
Go around doing as you please

178
00:12:48,420 --> 00:12:51,460
Think they've gained enough distance

179
00:12:51,460 --> 00:12:55,760
So there's no point in staying here

180
00:12:55,760 --> 00:13:03,860
He doesn't even have an Adola Link

181
00:13:03,860 --> 00:13:09,740
What a monster

182
00:13:09,740 --> 00:13:31,320
Hey, Captain Obie

183
00:13:31,320 --> 00:13:32,120
Yes, sir

184
00:13:32,120 --> 00:13:34,020
We got the kid to the hospital

185
00:13:34,020 --> 00:13:35,420
Yeah, him and Arthur

186
00:13:35,420 --> 00:13:42,100
The workshop's in shambles

187
00:13:42,100 --> 00:13:43,780
It was definitely the Whiteclad

188
00:13:43,780 --> 00:13:45,680
And Dr. Giovanni?

189
00:13:46,020 --> 00:13:47,020
He's one of them

190
00:13:47,020 --> 00:13:52,220
I also met a kid who I think is my brother

191
00:13:52,220 --> 00:13:54,800
Vulcan's all right

192
00:13:54,800 --> 00:13:55,940
That said

193
00:13:55,940 --> 00:13:58,060
The Whiteclad might come after him again

194
00:13:58,060 --> 00:14:00,520
We'll stay close just in case

195
00:14:00,520 --> 00:14:02,920
Yeah, I think that might be for the best, sir

196
00:14:02,920 --> 00:14:04,880
We'll wait for you to get here

197
00:14:04,880 --> 00:14:15,680
So, uh, Vulcan

198
00:14:15,680 --> 00:14:17,280
Why don't you come to the 8th?

199
00:14:17,780 --> 00:14:18,640
Just as a guest

200
00:14:18,640 --> 00:14:20,280
Think you'd be safer there

201
00:14:20,280 --> 00:14:22,900
Okay

202
00:14:22,900 --> 00:14:25,160
I'll do that

203
00:14:25,160 --> 00:14:26,860
Thanks, Shinra

204
00:14:26,860 --> 00:14:35,160
This isn't how I wanted things to pan out at all

205
00:14:35,160 --> 00:14:36,840
Thought we'd charm you

206
00:14:36,840 --> 00:14:39,460
Convince you that the 8th was the place to be

207
00:14:39,460 --> 00:14:41,780
I'm so sorry

208
00:14:41,780 --> 00:14:43,760
We all fought as hard as we could

209
00:14:43,760 --> 00:14:45,520
But we couldn't protect you

210
00:14:45,520 --> 00:14:47,520
Or your family

211
00:14:47,520 --> 00:14:53,160
You don't have anything to apologize for

212
00:14:53,160 --> 00:14:56,280
You warned me that danger was heading my way

213
00:14:56,280 --> 00:14:59,020
And I made the choice not to listen

214
00:14:59,020 --> 00:15:03,120
I know Ye's just a kid

215
00:15:03,120 --> 00:15:05,240
But he's a lot tougher than he looks

216
00:15:05,240 --> 00:15:08,120
And Lisa isn't really...

217
00:15:08,120 --> 00:15:13,640
There ain't a thing in this world that can't be fixed

218
00:15:13,640 --> 00:15:15,680
So Lisa's gonna come around

219
00:15:15,680 --> 00:15:17,220
And Ye's gonna heal up

220
00:15:17,220 --> 00:15:18,920
Once I've got them

221
00:15:18,920 --> 00:15:20,580
It's back to fixing this world

222
00:15:20,580 --> 00:15:22,900
What about you?

223
00:15:23,720 --> 00:15:25,500
Seeing your brother like that must have hurt

224
00:15:25,500 --> 00:15:27,540
You don't need to worry about me

225
00:15:27,540 --> 00:15:30,640
I know I'm not the only person who's got it bad

226
00:15:30,640 --> 00:15:33,480
It's the world we live in

227
00:15:33,480 --> 00:15:35,080
Same boat and all that

228
00:15:35,080 --> 00:15:39,060
That's true

229
00:15:39,060 --> 00:15:40,660
We're in this together

230
00:15:40,660 --> 00:15:42,140
So, hey

231
00:15:42,140 --> 00:15:44,140
When you start working towards your dream

232
00:15:44,140 --> 00:15:45,640
I'll be glad to help out

233
00:15:45,640 --> 00:15:47,160
Count on it

234
00:15:47,160 --> 00:15:50,300
I appreciate that

235
00:15:50,300 --> 00:15:56,240
Tell me

236
00:15:56,240 --> 00:15:59,760
How did you know to show up just in time to save the day?

237
00:16:00,480 --> 00:16:01,220
Got lucky?

238
00:16:01,800 --> 00:16:03,420
They took so long to get back

239
00:16:03,420 --> 00:16:05,000
I figured I'd go and check on them

240
00:16:05,000 --> 00:16:12,400
Or maybe it's because you were the one who led the white clad out there in the first place

241
00:16:12,400 --> 00:16:14,000
That's ridiculous!

242
00:16:14,680 --> 00:16:15,560
So not true

243
00:16:15,560 --> 00:16:18,860
Why would I bring them there just to help you guys get away from them?

244
00:16:22,280 --> 00:16:26,760
Step one toe out of line and I will crush you until you turn from gravel to sand

245
00:16:26,760 --> 00:16:33,960
Arthur's wounds weren't nearly as bad as I thought

246
00:16:33,960 --> 00:16:35,920
But there's always next time

247
00:16:35,920 --> 00:16:39,440
It wasn't long before Ye was out of the woods as well

248
00:16:39,440 --> 00:16:42,000
At Captain Obi's invitation

249
00:16:42,000 --> 00:16:45,300
Vulcan ended up taking refuge at Company 8

250
00:16:45,300 --> 00:16:54,480
Show really is serving the evangelist

251
00:16:54,480 --> 00:16:56,580
But I'll help him come around

252
00:16:56,580 --> 00:16:59,260
No matter what it takes

253
00:16:59,260 --> 00:17:01,180
I will keep my promise

254
00:17:01,180 --> 00:17:06,160
I'm so sorry about them!

255
00:17:07,720 --> 00:17:11,500
Thought I'd open with that in case our rookies were disrespectful towards you

256
00:17:11,500 --> 00:17:13,540
You're astoundingly stupid

257
00:17:13,540 --> 00:17:14,360
You're polite

258
00:17:14,360 --> 00:17:15,460
Way polite

259
00:17:15,460 --> 00:17:17,320
Their manners were just fine

260
00:17:17,320 --> 00:17:18,900
If anyone was rude, it was me

261
00:17:18,900 --> 00:17:20,340
Food's on the table

262
00:17:20,340 --> 00:17:21,300
Come and get it!

263
00:17:21,860 --> 00:17:22,600
Who made it?

264
00:17:22,920 --> 00:17:23,500
Was it you?

265
00:17:24,160 --> 00:17:24,500
No

266
00:17:24,500 --> 00:17:26,060
The lieutenant cooked it himself

267
00:17:26,060 --> 00:17:27,320
Since we had a guest coming

268
00:17:27,320 --> 00:17:28,520
Whoa, for real?

269
00:17:28,740 --> 00:17:29,360
Hell yeah!

270
00:17:29,580 --> 00:17:31,240
Hey, what's that supposed to mean?

271
00:17:31,460 --> 00:17:32,640
I feel like you can guess

272
00:17:32,640 --> 00:17:34,120
What are you scared to say it yourself?

273
00:17:39,700 --> 00:17:41,360
Wow, this looks amazing

274
00:17:41,360 --> 00:17:42,120
Nice work

275
00:17:42,120 --> 00:17:43,460
I'm friggin' starving

276
00:17:43,460 --> 00:17:48,260
Hey, what's the big idea?

277
00:17:48,580 --> 00:17:51,860
That was punishment for making me defend the workshop by myself

278
00:17:51,860 --> 00:17:53,020
You're kidding me

279
00:17:53,020 --> 00:17:55,120
I was kind of busy getting ambushed, okay?

280
00:17:55,320 --> 00:17:56,580
Well, don't let that happen

281
00:17:56,580 --> 00:17:58,960
Don't act like everything went perfect on your end

282
00:17:58,960 --> 00:17:59,200
Huh?

283
00:17:59,960 --> 00:18:02,040
Sorry, those two can get pretty loud

284
00:18:02,040 --> 00:18:04,760
I grew up in a machine shop

